The value of a result, or a default. A result is [0 value] or [1 message], as the parser gives them. The input is the pair [result default]: a success gives its value, and a failure gives the default.
---

---
(lam p (if (= (head (head p)) 0) (tail (head p)) (tail p)))
---
[[0 5] 9] => 5 fuel 100000
[[1 "bad"] 9] => 9 fuel 100000
[[0 ~] 9] => ~ fuel 100000
